parallel is module
parallel purpose "Show tasks overlapping in time, a group limit holding, and a producer and consumer meeting through a one-slot channel"
parallel path parallel
parallel imports standard.console
parallel imports standard.time
parallel imports standard.clock
parallel imports standard.math
parallel imports standard.compare
parallel imports standard.channel
parallel exports main

